# LaTeX build byproducts under latex-template/, regenerated by
# latex-template/build.sh from the Obsidian markdown source. The compiled
# Main.tex itself IS tracked (not ignored): this repo syncs with Overleaf via
# git, and Overleaf needs the main .tex committed alongside its .sty/.bst/.bib
# dependencies to compile the project at all. Only the ephemeral per-compile
# outputs are excluded here — Overleaf (and a local pdflatex run) regenerates
# all of these from Main.tex on every build.
latex-template/*.aux
latex-template/*.log
latex-template/*.out
latex-template/*.bbl
latex-template/*.blg
latex-template/*.pdflatex.log
latex-template/*.pdf
latex-template/*.png

conflict-files-obsidian-git.md
Main.tex
